# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Deevuh Backend — Production Environment Template
# Copy to .env and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env to version control.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

NODE_ENV=production
PORT=5000

# ─── Database (Supabase / managed PostgreSQL) ───
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/deevuh_prod?sslmode=require

# ─── Redis (Upstash / ElastiCache) ───
REDIS_URL=rediss://default:password@host:6379

# ─── Authentication ───
# Generate with: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(64).toString('hex'))"
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=CHANGE_ME_64_CHAR_RANDOM
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=CHANGE_ME_64_CHAR_RANDOM_DIFFERENT

# ─── Google OAuth ───
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ─── Razorpay ───
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_xxxx
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ─── Shiprocket ───
SHIPROCKET_EMAIL=
SHIPROCKET_PASSWORD=

# ─── AWS S3 (Product images) ───
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_S3_BUCKET=deevuh-media
AWS_REGION=ap-south-1

# ─── Search (Meilisearch Cloud or self-hosted) ───
MEILISEARCH_HOST=https://ms.deevuh.com
MEILISEARCH_API_KEY=

# ─── Email (Resend) ───
RESEND_API_KEY=
EMAIL_FROM=hello@deevuh.com

# ─── Frontend URL (for CORS and email links) ───
FRONTEND_URL=https://deevuh.com
